<div class="mk-crumbbar"><div class="mk-wrap in"><a href="#">Markets</a><span class="sep">&rsaquo;</span><a href="/markets/power-management">Power Management</a><span class="sep">&rsaquo;</span><span class="here">Power Discrete Assembly</span></div></div><div class="mk-spoke-grid"><aside class="mk-side"><div class="side-head"><span class="side-head-label">Power Management products</span><button type="button" class="mk-side-toggle" aria-label="Collapse sidebar"><span class="chev"><i data-lucide="chevron-right" style="width:13px;height:13px;"></i></span></button></div><a class="s" href="/markets/power-management/igbt-sic-modules"><span class="abbr">IS</span><span class="label">IGBT &amp; SiC Power Modules</span></a><a class="s active" href="/markets/power-management/power-discrete"><span class="abbr">PD</span><span class="label">Power Discrete Assembly</span></a><div class="helper"><div class="h">Not sure which fits?</div><p>Tell us the device, the current and the package and we&rsquo;ll point you to the right line.</p><a class="cta" href="/contact">Work with us <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></a></div></aside><div class="mk-spoke-main"><section class="mk-hero" data-hana-bg="flow" data-variant="light" data-fade="none"><div class="mk-wrap mk-hero-in"><div><div class="mk-eyebrow">Power Management &middot; Power Discrete Assembly</div><h1 class="mk-h1">Power discrete semiconductor assembly</h1><p class="mk-lede">Hana manufactures power discrete semiconductor packages at volume with controlled die attach, wire or clip interconnect, molding, deflash, plating and lead-finish processes. The manufacturing scope covers both through-hole and surface-mount package formats for silicon and wide-bandgap devices.</p><div class="mk-btns"><a href="/contact" class="hana-btn hana-btn-primary" style="padding:12px 22px;font-size:12px;">Talk to us <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:14px;height:14px;margin-left:6px;"></i></a><a href="#specialize-power-discrete" class="hana-btn hana-btn-secondary" style="padding:12px 22px;font-size:12px;">What we specialize in</a></div></div><div class="mk-hero-media"><div class="mk-ph" style="aspect-ratio:auto;height:420px;border-bottom:0;"><div style="position:absolute;top:10px;left:12px;width:18px;height:18px;opacity:.4;z-index:1;"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--hana-blue)" stroke-width="1.5"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"></circle><path d="M12 3v4M12 17v4M3 12h4M17 12h4"></path></svg></div><span class="cap">[ Power Discrete Assembly &mdash; photography needed ]</span></div></div></div></section><section id="specialize-power-discrete" data-hana-bg="hex" data-variant="light" data-fade="none" style="background:var(--bg);border-top:1px solid var(--line);position:relative;overflow:hidden;"><div class="mk-wrap" style="position:relative;z-index:1;padding-top:64px;padding-bottom:60px;"><div style="max-width:700px;margin-bottom:26px;"><h2 class="mk-h2">What we specialize in</h2><p class="mk-body">Hana packages SiC MOSFETs and diodes, superjunction MOS and FRFET devices, and silicon MOSFETs with copper-clip interconnect on OSAT lines in Thailand and China. Available package formats include through-hole and surface-mount outlines in leadframe and DBC constructions, with lead-finish processes integrated into the manufacturing flow.</p></div><div class="mk-sheet"><div class="row"><div class="lab"><span class="n">01</span><span class="t">Through-hole power packages</span></div><div class="desc">TO-247 in 2L, 3L and 4L formats, together with TO-272 in plastic and ceramic versions.</div></div><div class="row"><div class="lab"><span class="n">02</span><span class="t">Surface-mount power packages</span></div><div class="desc">D2PAK-7L in leadframe and DBC versions for board-mounted power applications.</div></div><div class="row"><div class="lab"><span class="n">03</span><span class="t">Wide-bandgap and silicon devices</span></div><div class="desc">SiC MOSFET and diode, superjunction MOS, FRFET and silicon MOSFET devices, including copper-clip interconnect.</div></div><div class="row"><div class="lab"><span class="n">04</span><span class="t">Lead finish and flank quality</span></div><div class="desc">Wettable-flank formation using step-cut or dimpled leadframes, with pure-tin plating and chemical deflash available according to program requirements.</div></div></div><div class="mk-caplinks"><p class="note">See IC Assembly &amp; Test for the die attach, clip and wire bonding, molding, wafer probe and final-test processes supporting these package formats.</p><div class="links"><a href="/capabilities/osat">Explore IC Assembly &amp; Test <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></a></div></div></div></section><section class="mk-dark"><div class="mk-wrap in"><div style="max-width:820px;"><h2 class="mk-h2 on-dark">Copper clip and lead-finish processes</h2><p class="mk-body on-dark" style="margin:0 0 14px;">Copper-clip interconnect is available where a package requires a high-current, low-resistance connection in place of conventional wire bonding. Wettable-flank lead formats can also be produced using step-cut or dimpled leadframes, with pure-tin plating to support downstream solder-joint inspection. Chemical deflash is available after molding as part of the finishing process. The applicable construction and finish are selected according to program requirements.</p><p class="mk-body on-dark" style="margin:0 0 14px;">Hana's scope covers the packaged power device; integration into the finished converter, motor drive or power supply remains within the customer's system.</p></div></div></section><section style="background:var(--hana-blue-tint);border-top:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);"><div class="mk-wrap" style="padding-top:56px;padding-bottom:56px;"><div style="max-width:700px;margin-bottom:24px;"><div class="mk-eyebrow">Footprint</div><h2 class="mk-h2 sm">Where we build</h2></div><div class="mk-locs"><a class="mk-loc" href="/locations/ayutthaya"><span class="co"><i data-lucide="map-pin" style="width:13px;height:13px;color:var(--hana-blue);"></i><span class="hana-spec-label">Thailand</span></span><div class="nm">Ayutthaya</div><div class="note">discrete packaging</div><span class="cta">View plant <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span></a><a class="mk-loc" href="/locations/jiaxing"><span class="co"><i data-lucide="map-pin" style="width:13px;height:13px;color:var(--hana-blue);"></i><span class="hana-spec-label">China</span></span><div class="nm">Jiaxing</div><div class="note">power discrete packaging</div><span class="cta">View plant <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span></a></div><p style="margin:18px 0 0;"><a href="/locations" class="hana-link" style="font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.1em;">All locations <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:13px;height:13px;"></i></a></p></div></section><section style="background:#fff;border-top:1px solid var(--line);"><div class="mk-wrap" style="padding-top:56px;padding-bottom:60px;"><div style="max-width:700px;margin-bottom:22px;"><div class="mk-eyebrow">FAQ</div><h2 class="mk-h2 sm">Frequently asked questions</h2></div><div style="max-width:860px;"><details class="mk-faq" open><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">What power packages can Hana assemble?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">Hana supports TO-247 in 2L, 3L and 4L formats, TO-272 in plastic and ceramic versions, and D2PAK-7L in leadframe and DBC versions. Device types include SiC MOSFET, SiC diode, superjunction MOS and FRFET, and silicon MOSFET with copper-clip interconnect.</p></details><details class="mk-faq"><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">How does discrete packaging differ from module assembly?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">A power discrete packages a single semiconductor device, while a power module typically combines multiple die on a shared substrate and thermal path. Hana supports both discrete and module assembly at its power-semiconductor manufacturing sites. See <a href="/markets/power-management/igbt-sic-modules">IGBT &amp; SiC power modules</a> for the module side.</p></details><details class="mk-faq"><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">What test coverage runs at the end of the line?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">Electrical test and reliability sequences can be applied according to the program qualification plan. Visual and dimensional checks, including lead condition and wettable-flank formation where applicable, are also part of the manufacturing process. The final test set is agreed per program and confirmed per site.</p></details></div><div style="margin-top:40px;padding-top:26px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);"><a href="/markets/power-management" class="hana-link" style="font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.1em;"><i data-lucide="arrow-left" style="width:13px;height:13px;"></i> Back to the Power Management market hub</a></div></div></section><section class="mk-cta" data-hana-bg="flow" data-variant="dark" data-fade="none"><div class="mk-wrap in"><div><h2 class="mk-h2 on-dark" style="max-width:520px;">Talk to us about your power discrete program</h2><p class="mk-body on-dark" style="font-size:16px;max-width:480px;">Tell us what you need built and we will come back with a plan.</p></div><div class="acts"><a href="/contact" class="hana-btn hana-btn-on-dark" style="padding:12px 22px;font-size:12px;">Contact us <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:14px;height:14px;margin-left:6px;"></i></a></div></div></section></div></div>